- File: `path/to/file.py:42`
- Severity: must-fix
- Source: qs-review-blind-hunter
- Description: ...
- Proposed fix: ...

(repeat for each fix)

## How to apply

Run `{{next_implement}}` against this fix plan. When done, return and
[% if harness == "claude" %]
